    the number of weeks drops by one each time, and a week count cannot be negative
  
  `weeks to go` uses itself again, directly or through other rules, but not through a HENCE or LEST, and L4 gives no warning about whether a rule like that comes to an end.
  So the mark changes nothing. That reason is what a reader should check.
